OL,3,GNEWSAFormer youth footballer accused of
OL,4,Akilling 21-year-old man in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former youth footballer has appeared
OL,7,Fin court charged with killing a
OL,8,F21-year-old man during a disturbance in
OL,9,FGlasgow city centre, then trying to
OL,10,Fflee the country.
OL,12,FDaniel Colrain, 21, was found with
OL,13,Fserious injuries in Royal Exchange
OL,14,FSquare at about 03:05 on Sunday. He was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital where he died on
OL,16,FMonday.
OL,18,FLuis Cameron, 19, is accused of
OL,19,Fculpable homicide by punching Colrain,
OL,20,Fcausing him to fall to the ground and
OL,21,Fstrike his head.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
