OL,3,GNEWSAFormer youth footballer accused of
OL,4,Akilling 21-year-old man in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FA second allegation claims Cameron, a
OL,7,Fformer Partick Thistle youth
OL,8,Fgoalkeeper, attempted to pervert the
OL,9,Fcourse of justice by booking a flight
OL,10,Ffrom Glasgow to Dubai later that day.
OL,11,FHe made no plea when he appeared at
OL,12,FGlasgow Sheriff Court.
